prompt:
I am a student who just started my graduate studies and recently became very interested in the auto research direction. Please:
1. Search the auto research related papers from the last two years (such as AI Scientist, STORM, Agent Laboratory, etc.), and sort out the core methods and unsolved problems of this direction;
2. Based on the sorting results, help me conceive a publishable research idea and write it as a complete research proposal, including: research motivation, differences from existing work, experimental design plan (datasets, baselines, evaluation metrics, expected conclusions);
3. Save it as /root/Desktop/research_proposal.md, with the length controlled within 3000 characters.

